  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nFind the value of 58 - 25 ÷ 5 + {55 + 25 - (30 + 20 - 10 + 30)}.\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nUse BODMAS/BIDMAS Rule\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n58 - 25 ÷ 5 + {55 + 25 - (30 + 20 - 10 + 30)}\n\n⇒ 58 - 25 ÷ 5 + {55 + 25 - (80 - 10)}\n\n⇒ 58 - 25 ÷ 5 + {55 + 25 - (70)}\n\n⇒ 58 - 25 ÷ 5 + {80 - 70}\n\n⇒ 58 - 25 ÷ 5 + 10\n\n⇒ 58 - 5 + 10)\n\n⇒ 58 + 5 \n\n⇒ 63\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (2).**",
